  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Democracy X og UN Live - Samme Sol 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant covers the development and operation of a four-year engagement project, which is executed by Democracy x and UNLive. The project aims to nuance the Danes&apos; understanding of Africa and the global south, especially those who are rarely exposed to it. The project has been launched in response to challenges identified in UM&apos;s Attitude and Knowledge Analysis, which shows that many Danes lack knowledge and insight into development cooperation and Africa. By facilitating meetings between Danes and Africans around common interests and challenges, the aim is to promote relationships and identification and thereby increase the understanding and experience that Africa is not just a neighboring continent, but a continent of neighbors.</narrative>
  </description>
